From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:59:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: zinwa-q25: describe audio, sensors and CONNSYS

Add what the Q25 now boots with (edc93beb..., the DTB staged as
q25-native-input-audio-sensors-connsys-btif-nobl.dtb):

- the AFE, its I2S pin states, the OCA72390 speaker amplifier on i2c3
  and the sound card;
- the stock SCP sensor buses handed to AP controllers: MMC5603 on i2c1,
  HX32062SE on i2c9 and the ICM-42607-P IMU on spi2;
- CONNSYS, the AXI Wi-Fi core and BTIF, with the CONSYS EMI moved to
  0x7e000000 where LK reserves it, the Wi-Fi pool made a DMA pool and
  the watchdog providing the CONN MCU reset;
- the old 0x7d000000 carveout kept reserved as q25-held.

The BMP390 node of the staged DTB is left out: both of its addresses
NACK on the device, so the barometer is not fitted. Apart from that
node the result equals edc93beb node by node. No gpio-backlight.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789-zinwa-q25.dts |  376 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 374 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789-zinwa-q25.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789-zinwa-q25.dts
index 911721c..8ba574b 100644
